Gitea 1.22.6
Source: https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/tree/v1.22.6
Release binary: https://dl.gitea.com/gitea/1.22.6/gitea-1.22.6-linux-amd64
License: MIT; the complete upstream copyright and license are in LICENSE.

This package contains the unmodified official Linux amd64 binary. start.sh and
seed.py configure SQLite, instance storage and the initial accounts, and disable
Git hooks, local-path imports, SSH and mail. They do not modify the program.
SOURCE.json records the verified release download and instance configuration.
